{'symbol': 'KO', 'date': '2022-09-29 06:30:00', 'title': 'MOLSON COORS EXPANDS EXCLUSIVE AGREEMENT WITH THE COCA-COLA COMPANY TO LAUNCH TOPO CHICO SPIRITED LINE OF CANNED COCKTAILS', 'text': "ALREADY THE FASTEST-GROWING BRAND IN THE HARD-SELTZER SEGMENT, THE TOPO CHICO TRADEMARK WILL MOVE INTO SPIRIT-BASED, READY-TO-DRINK COCKTAILS IN 2023 CHICAGO , SEPT. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MOLSON COORS BEVERAGE COMPANY\xa0(NYSE: TAP)\xa0HAS EXPANDED ITS EXCLUSIVE AGREEMENT WITH THE COCA-COLA COMPANY TO DEVELOP AND COMMERCIALIZE TOPO CHICO\xa0SPIRITED, A LINE OF SPIRIT-BASED, READY-TO-DRINK COCKTAILS INSPIRED BY THE BRIGHT AND REFRESHING TASTE OF SOME OF AMERICA'S MOST BELOVED TEQUILA AND VODKA-BASED BEVERAGES."}